      "message": "FYI, (Don\u0027t need to do this in this CL)\n\nWe can make some steps to fix b/183742505 here:\n\nInstead of setting `includeDirs \u003d baseCompilerProps.Include_dirs`, instead:\n\n    for _, rawIncludeDir :\u003d range baseCompilerProps.Include_dirs {\n        localizedIncludeDir :\u003d strings.TrimPrefix(rawIncludeDir, ctx.ModuleDir() + \"/\")\n        includeDirs \u003d append(includeDirs, localizedIncludeDir)\n    }\n\nThis gets part of the way there; if an absolute include_dir lives under the current directory, it makes the path relative.\nHowever, there are more complicated scenarios which aren\u0027t fixed by this, and need a more clever solution. For example, //bionic/libc:libc_openbsd depends on include path \"system/core/libcutils/include\", which exists globally elsewhere.\n\nWe may need to consider refactoring such inclusions into header libraries prior to migration...",
